Relay is an independent fork, not an official Agentrium, Anthropic or OpenAI product.

The active Relay PTY runtime derives lifecycle and streaming patterns from
Agentrium's terminal.rs, with new durable identity, hooks and state management.
The frontend, persistence model and background rules are focused replacements.
Upstream Git history and the original README are preserved for provenance.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. Notable components:
Tauri (MIT/Apache-2.0), portable-pty (MIT), xterm.js (MIT), React (MIT),
SQLite (public domain), rusqlite (MIT), Lucide (ISC).
Agent providers and their CLIs are separately installed and licensed.
